SUB TPSETROM (X, Y, P)

 GET (14 * P, 166)-(14 * P + 12, 180), FMV
 PUT (X, Y), FMV, AND
 GET (14 * P, 150)-(14 * P + 12, 164), FMV
 PUT (X, Y), FMV, OR

